Interpolation expansion hits the configured byte limit before emitting a token.
-- options.json --
{"MaxOutputBytes":8}
-- input.roff --
.ds S 123456
ok
\*[S]\*[S]
-- error.txt --
output byte budget exceeded
-- expected.txt --
groff.TokenText "ok"
string S="123456"
error evaluate token 2 (): evaluation output byte budget exceeded (8)
